sequenceDiagram
    participant Device as Device
    participant Factory as Authorized factory
    participant Enroll as Factory enrollment
    participant Cloud as Runtime token service
    Device->>Device: Generate and retain device private key
    Device->>Factory: CSR and immutable production context
    Factory->>Enroll: HTTPS POST /v1/factory/enroll (factory JWT, CSR)
    alt Factory authorization and production context valid
        Enroll-->>Factory: Issued device certificate and metadata
        Factory-->>Device: Certificate matching retained key
        Note over Device,Cloud: Claim and activation are separate prerequisites
        Device->>Cloud: mTLS POST /request_token (scope=device, devid)
        Cloud-->>Device: Runtime token or policy rejection
    else Enrollment denied
        Enroll-->>Factory: HTTP error, no usable identity
    end
